## =========================================================================
## Android Local Environment Configuration Example
## =========================================================================
## Salin file ini menjadi 'local.properties' untuk konfigurasi lokal mesin Anda.
## File 'local.properties' otomatis diabaikan oleh git (.gitignore).
##
## Prioritas Pembacaan Konfigurasi:
## 1. System Environment Variables (CI/CD GitHub Actions)
## 2. File root monorepo '.env' (di-generate otomatis oleh ENV_FILE secret di CI/CD)
## 3. File 'local.properties' ini (di laptop pengembang lokal)
## 4. Fallback nilai default (Production Cloud)
## =========================================================================

## Lokasi Android SDK di komputer lokal (Android Studio biasanya mengisi ini otomatis)
# sdk.dir=/Users/username/Library/Android/sdk

## -------------------------------------------------------------------------
## Backend API & Real-time Event Stream (SSE)
## -------------------------------------------------------------------------
## Cloud Production:
API_BASE_URL=https://be-task-hub.eka-dev.cloud/api/v1/
SSE_URL=https://be-task-hub.eka-dev.cloud/api/v1/realtime/sse/events

## Local Emulator Testing (10.0.2.2 adalah IP alias localhost host mesin di Android Emulator):
# DEV_BASE_URL=http://10.0.2.2:3000/api/v1/
# DEV_SSE_URL=http://10.0.2.2:3000/api/v1/realtime/sse/events

